{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果計劃於10月24日星期六關閉法國境內7家Apple Store，其中包括巴黎的三家門店：香榭麗舍大道店、歌劇院店和聖日耳曼市場店。巴黎周邊購物中心內的蘋果門店預計照常營業。三家巴黎門店將於次日重新開放，但營業時間縮短為中午12時至下午6時；另外四家臨時關閉的門店位於巴黎以外，報道未公佈具體名稱。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583622.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T20:24:17.369466+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":155,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T20:12:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T20:18:20.768562+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T20:18:20.768562+00:00","content_hash":"8be92f7c952fdde8577ce297f26f0778532a58fa4e5af27f004f383a1b8cdbba","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}